  "abstract": "Fourier LN baseline with scalar per-factor context, gamma[t] initialized as 0.25\u21920.99 ramp, residual copy head, Adam lr=1e-3, global grad clip=1.0, MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4). Exports gamma/frequency stats on complete().",
